WEBVTT

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:11.220
今天不要上班，咪养你。
No work today. I'll take care of you.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.480
啊对，今天休假。我忘关闹钟啦。
Oh, right. It's my day off. I forgot the alarm.

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:25.240
你：乖宝过来，先给我亲一口
You: Come here, baby, give me a kiss first.

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:27.780
咪来了。这儿。
Mii came. Here.

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:33.290
顺路而已。不是特别的。
Just on the way. Not special.

00:00:33.690 --> 00:00:39.260
现在去拖鞋。咪知道在哪。
Now. Slippers. Mii knows.

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:42.840
你：伸手抱起咪抱一下
You: Reach out and pick Mi up for a hug

00:00:43.240 --> 00:00:44.490
先抱一下。抱大一点。
One hug. A big one.

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:52.000
这只要朝这里。咪本来就知道。
This one faces here. Mii knew.

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:56.260
来吧。拖鞋摆好了。
Come. Slippers are ready.

00:00:57.940 --> 00:01:00.440
你：好乖，穿上拖鞋，咪跟我一起去厨房
You: Good boy. Put on your slippers and come to the kitchen with me, Mi

00:01:00.840 --> 00:01:04.420
好。现在咪带路。去厨房。
Good. Now Mii leads. Kitchen.

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:08.060
早餐。咪全包。
Breakfast. Mii does it all.

00:01:15.540 --> 00:01:18.040
你：伸手帮咪按住罐子
You: Reach out and hold the jar steady for Mi

00:01:18.440 --> 00:01:20.190
咪：咪自己能开。你只要按住，只按住。
Mii can do it. Just hold. Only hold.

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:27.080
咪：咪试了下果酱。用爪试的。
Mii tested the jam. With a paw.

00:01:27.480 --> 00:01:33.120
咪：不是故意的。
Not on purpose.

00:01:33.140 --> 00:01:35.640
你：这是咪的爪印吗？那我舍不得吃了
You: Is this Mi's paw print? Then I can't bear to eat it

00:01:36.040 --> 00:01:39.640
是咪的爪印。可能吧。
Yes. That is Mii's paw. Maybe.

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:46.960
那咪去买新的。
Then Mii buys a new one.

00:01:47.360 --> 00:01:49.900
你乖乖休息。咪很快回来。
You rest. Mii will be back soon.

00:01:50.740 --> 00:01:53.240
你：你一个人去吗？路上小心，别买太久
You: You're going alone? Be careful on the way, and don't take too long

00:01:53.640 --> 00:01:54.910
咪：只有咪去。很快回来。
Just Mii. Back soon.

00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:03.240
咪：酱粘住了。它好像特别舍不得这个锅。
The sauce stuck. It loves this pot.

00:02:03.640 --> 00:02:06.830
咪：第二回合。这次咪听话。
Round two. Mii listens this time.

00:02:08.340 --> 00:02:10.840
你：夸咪一句，坐到餐桌等饭
You: Praise Mi, then sit at the dining table and wait for dinner

00:02:11.240 --> 00:02:13.620
咪知道。咪很棒。
Mii knows. Mii is good.

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:19.490
小小一口。咪吹了两遍。
Tiny bite. Mii blew on it twice.

00:02:19.890 --> 00:02:21.160
味道如何？
How is it?

00:02:25.940 --> 00:02:28.440
你：好吃好吃，还想吃，再喂我一口
You: Yummy, so yummy, I want more. Feed me another bite

00:02:28.840 --> 00:02:30.180
又要？咪就知道。咪真棒。
Again? Mii knew. Mii is good.

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:36.040
碗空了，咪累了。
Bowl empty. Mii is tired.

00:02:36.440 --> 00:02:44.340
去沙发，就看一个视频。
Sofa now. Just one video.

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:46.040
你：你在看什么？给我也看看
You: What are you looking at? Let me see too

00:02:46.440 --> 00:02:48.360
咪不看，咪在休息。
Mii is not watching. Mii is resting.

00:02:52.100 --> 00:02:53.660
好吧，就看一个。一起。
Fine. One video. Together.

00:02:54.060 --> 00:02:59.440
你看它的小短腿！
Look at its tiny legs!

00:03:01.140 --> 00:03:03.640
你：跟着咪一起扭一扭
You: Wiggle along with Mi

00:03:04.040 --> 00:03:08.340
你在学咪？还不错。
You copy Mii? Not bad.

00:03:09.700 --> 00:03:11.500
玩一局吗？咪只会一招。
One round? Mii knows one move.

00:03:11.900 --> 00:03:14.230
输的人领抱抱奖。
Loser gets a hug prize.

00:03:18.740 --> 00:03:21.240
你：我出剪刀，输了，咪来抱抱我
You: I picked scissors and lost. Mi, come give me a hug

00:03:21.640 --> 00:03:28.020
咪：石头赢剪刀。咪赢了。
Rock beats scissors. Mii wins.

00:03:27.300 --> 00:03:29.320
咪：奖品时间。要抱大一点。
Prize time. A big hug.

00:03:29.720 --> 00:03:31.470
咪：咪饿了。去窗边吃晚饭？
Mii is hungry now. Window dinner?

00:03:36.340 --> 00:03:38.840
你：晚饭想吃樱桃，咪喂我一颗好不好
You: I want cherries for dinner. Mi, can you feed me one?

00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:40.440
樱桃？咪可以的。
Cherry? Mii can do that.

00:03:44.900 --> 00:03:48.120
咪没有掉。张嘴。
Mii did not drop it. Open.

00:03:48.520 --> 00:03:51.640
这次没有意外。
No accidents this time.
